# WhatsApp sidecar (apps/media-core-worker): deliberately vendored, unlike every other
# node_modules in this repo. WhatsAppSidecarProcessSupervisor launches it as a self-contained
# child process next to a vendored portable Node.js runtime (native/win-x64/node/), so its
# dependencies ship with the build instead of requiring `npm install` or Node.js itself on the
# target machine — same "no machine-level dependency" reasoning as native/win-x64/README.md
# already documents for ffmpeg.
!/apps/media-core-worker/src/Workers/Operations.Worker/sidecar-whatsapp/node_modules/